1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Ninth Episode
The Melted Icicle

15
00:01:52,301 --> 00:01:55,771
Sapphire, blinded,
has been taken away by Satan.

16
00:01:56,021 --> 00:01:59,013
She knows that the King and the Queen
are on the Island of Snakes..

17
00:01:59,061 --> 00:02:01,336
..turned into stone statues.

18
00:02:01,581 --> 00:02:06,530
Helped by Zelda, daughter of Satan,
she tries to help them, but falls into the sea

19
00:02:06,821 --> 00:02:09,016
She is saved by the pirate Blood

20
00:02:09,061 --> 00:02:11,052
With him she goes to the magic spring..

21
00:02:11,101 --> 00:02:14,252
...and thanks to the miraculous water
she regains her sight.

22
00:02:14,621 --> 00:02:18,409
Then she returns to Coolland to
fight Queen Icicle,

23
00:02:18,741 --> 00:02:23,212
who has built a new
powerful weapon: the iron lion.

24
00:02:23,541 --> 00:02:26,339
Sapphire confronts him
and manages to destroy him.

25
00:02:26,741 --> 00:02:29,813
But in the battle, her
friend Choppy is hit...

26
00:02:30,021 --> 00:02:32,091
..and Sapphire
believes him dead.

27
00:02:32,341 --> 00:02:35,856
Zelda arrives to warn Sapphire
that her father and mother...

28
00:02:35,901 --> 00:02:40,213
...are in danger, because Satan
wants to smash their statues to pieces.

29
00:02:40,341 --> 00:02:43,492
Sapphire sets off immediately
for the Island of Serpents.

30
00:03:00,181 --> 00:03:03,969
What are you waiting for? Make
a second iron lion immediately!

31
00:03:04,021 --> 00:03:06,410
Send a mission to
the Crystal Valley!

32
00:03:07,101 --> 00:03:09,535
It's horrible! The Queen
is a terrible woman...

33
00:03:09,581 --> 00:03:11,651
...for having asked to
make such a weapon!

34
00:03:14,661 --> 00:03:18,415
Arrest that young man!
He spoke ill of the Queen!

35
00:03:27,901 --> 00:03:30,210
I'm saved! Incredible!

36
00:03:31,341 --> 00:03:33,730
I'm afraid that Sapphire
is worried about me.

37
00:03:33,901 --> 00:03:37,655
Hey, Sapphire, where
are you? Sapphire!

38
00:03:39,501 --> 00:03:41,935
I will ask the birds,
they will know!

39
00:03:43,261 --> 00:03:45,491
Can you tell me where Sapphire is?

40
00:03:58,741 --> 00:04:00,618
Welcome, Sapphire!

41
00:04:01,501 --> 00:04:03,571
Listen, Satan, I have come here.

42
00:04:03,621 --> 00:04:06,294
...because I want you to
help my father and my mother.

43
00:04:06,741 --> 00:04:09,619
All right! I will do it if you promise
me that you won't run away.

44
00:04:10,101 --> 00:04:12,296
I won't run away! I
swear on my sword...

45
00:04:12,341 --> 00:04:14,536
...that I won't run away!
- All right, then!

46
00:04:16,341 --> 00:04:19,413
Alé Satàn!

47
00:04:27,781 --> 00:04:29,772
- Oh, my dear!
- Your Majesty!

48
00:04:29,821 --> 00:04:31,971
- How do you feel?
- Fine, I think!

49
00:04:32,021 --> 00:04:34,330
Father! Mother!

50
00:04:34,421 --> 00:04:37,299
- I think I heard Sapphire's voice.
- Me too!

51
00:04:38,501 --> 00:04:41,493
Alé Satàn!

52
00:04:44,501 --> 00:04:48,460
Poor thing! Can't you send
Sapphire's parents to the castle?

53
00:04:48,821 --> 00:04:51,813
Forget about them! I can't
always take care of them!

54
00:04:52,341 --> 00:04:54,980
How mean you are!
They will starve to death!

55
00:04:55,741 --> 00:04:57,732
Shut up!

56
00:05:16,901 --> 00:05:19,813
There are people on
the Island of Serpents!

57
00:05:19,861 --> 00:05:21,738
- People?
- Yes, Your Majesty!

58
00:05:21,781 --> 00:05:26,059
And the people on the island are
the King and Queen of Silverland!

59
00:05:26,101 --> 00:05:29,980
Show me! Go there
immediately, we must catch them!

60
00:05:30,021 --> 00:05:31,773
Yes, Queen!

61
00:05:37,981 --> 00:05:42,179
- Stop! You are under arrest!
- What are you doing? We are not criminals!

62
00:05:53,341 --> 00:05:55,252
My daughter..

63
00:05:58,781 --> 00:06:01,454
...tonight you will be born
a second time!

64
00:06:01,501 --> 00:06:04,095
I couldn't wait
for this moment to arrive

65
00:06:04,181 --> 00:06:07,139
You will be a witch
with a heart of stone!

66
00:06:10,861 --> 00:06:13,614
In celebration of the birth
of my witch...

67
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:15,731
Thunder, lightning, toast!

68
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:28,417
Are you tired? Now I'll have someone
take over for you, we're almost there!

69
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:48,936
My hands are paralyzed!

70
00:06:51,980 --> 00:06:54,017
Cursed Satan, go away!

71
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:01,737
Wait for me, dad!

72
00:07:07,220 --> 00:07:09,098
Sapphire!

73
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:16,493
- Choppy! So you're alive!
- Of course I'm alive! Look!

74
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:33,339
Look!

75
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:38,097
That is the Island of Snakes!

76
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:40,892
But... there is no one there!

77
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:44,331
As I predicted, Satan has sent
my father and my mother away.

78
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:47,174
It's incredible,
such a kind devil!

79
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:50,176
Anyway, I'm going back to Silverland.

80
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:05,137
Hey, who's there?

81
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:07,337
No, it's just a passing bird!

82
00:08:15,780 --> 00:08:18,215
- We'll wait for you next year!
- Thank you, birds!

83
00:08:22,220 --> 00:08:24,212
Choppy, come on, hurry!

84
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:29,094
- Is this the entrance to the secret passage?
- Shut up!

85
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:31,776
Why do you want to enter
through the secret passage?

86
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:34,699
Because, as I told you, there
is a fake Sapphire in the castle!

87
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:36,652
Let's go this way because
otherwise they might.

88
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:38,896
...send us back
like last time.

89
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:41,136
If we go left
we'll reach the crypt!

90
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:45,252
Look, this is moving!

91
00:08:46,621 --> 00:08:48,100
Up!

92
00:08:54,581 --> 00:08:56,890
Be careful not to fall
into that old well!

93
00:08:57,421 --> 00:08:59,537
What a terrible place
this is! My goodness!

94
00:09:07,181 --> 00:09:09,297
Don't move,
someone is coming!

95
00:09:14,421 --> 00:09:16,412
It's you! How did you get here?

96
00:09:17,901 --> 00:09:20,290
This damn fake Sapphire!

97
00:09:22,701 --> 00:09:25,420
I will kill you!

98
00:09:29,261 --> 00:09:31,172
I think she's dead!

99
00:09:34,781 --> 00:09:38,012
- But this is my room!
- Now we are safe!

100
00:09:42,821 --> 00:09:45,381
Don't be afraid.
It's an eagle, don't you see?

101
00:09:45,741 --> 00:09:49,780
An eagle?! How beautiful and big it is!
Who knows where it comes from? Hello! Hello!

102
00:09:55,821 --> 00:09:57,618
This is a letter!

103
00:09:58,741 --> 00:10:01,096
- What does it say?
- My father and my mother.

104
00:10:01,141 --> 00:10:03,132
...have been taken
by Queen Icicle!

105
00:10:03,181 --> 00:10:05,172
How the hell did that happen?

106
00:10:05,421 --> 00:10:07,981
Luckily we managed
to take prisoner...

107
00:10:08,021 --> 00:10:11,252
- the King and Queen of Silverland!
- Then it's true!

108
00:10:18,261 --> 00:10:21,856
All this thanks
to the great power of the Queen.

109
00:10:21,981 --> 00:10:25,610
Tomorrow the Queen herself
will send a letter to Silverland..

110
00:10:25,661 --> 00:10:27,572
...asking them to surrender.

111
00:10:27,621 --> 00:10:31,694
You will pretend to be Sapphire until
the very end, you will come to Coolland...

112
00:10:31,781 --> 00:10:34,534
...and you will affix
the seal of surrender!

113
00:10:37,621 --> 00:10:39,100
No!

114
00:10:39,421 --> 00:10:41,935
- I can't!
- But if you don't surrender

115
00:10:41,981 --> 00:10:44,939
Your father and your mother will face
real danger.

116
00:10:45,581 --> 00:10:47,651
Then what can I do?

117
00:10:47,701 --> 00:10:49,771
How can I help
my father and my mother...

118
00:10:49,821 --> 00:10:52,460
...and at the same time
protect Silverland?

119
00:10:52,941 --> 00:10:55,739
I don't know either.
Anyway, what is certain,

120
00:10:55,821 --> 00:10:58,619
...is that we must destroy
Queen Icicle.

121
00:10:58,981 --> 00:11:01,256
- Queen Icicle?!
- Yes!

122
00:11:01,341 --> 00:11:04,060
But even if you are strong,
you cannot do such a thing...

123
00:11:04,101 --> 00:11:06,934
...because there are many soldiers
following the Queen.

124
00:11:07,221 --> 00:11:10,816
Choppy! Yes, I can do it!
It's easy for me!

125
00:11:10,861 --> 00:11:14,536
I will pretend to be the fake Sapphire
and I will go visit the Queen.

126
00:11:23,581 --> 00:11:26,653
If Sapphire were to die
it would be truly terrible!

127
00:11:27,021 --> 00:11:29,012
I must help her at all costs

128
00:11:30,901 --> 00:11:32,812
The eagle is gone!

129
00:11:33,701 --> 00:11:36,340
I've got it!
I'll ask Peter of the woods!

130
00:11:39,941 --> 00:11:41,818
Peter!

131
00:11:42,501 --> 00:11:44,412
Hey, Peter!

132
00:11:45,941 --> 00:11:49,411
Hi, Peter! Hi!
I have to ask you a favor, please!

133
00:11:50,621 --> 00:11:52,896
Take me to the Crystal Valley!

134
00:11:56,781 --> 00:11:58,976
The Crystal Valley...

135
00:12:06,901 --> 00:12:09,654
There are many people there
who love Sapphire.

136
00:12:11,581 --> 00:12:15,574
When I was there too,
they all treated me lovingly.

137
00:12:18,181 --> 00:12:20,331
There are no bad people.

138
00:12:24,341 --> 00:12:27,811
They were only brought there
because they opposed the Queen.

139
00:12:32,341 --> 00:12:35,731
I want to free them somehow,
so they will help Sapphire!

140
00:12:43,421 --> 00:12:47,380
Please, use your instinct to find
the hole the mice know, come on!

141
00:13:02,901 --> 00:13:04,619
Thank you, Peter!

142
00:13:05,741 --> 00:13:07,652
Goodbye!

143
00:13:09,901 --> 00:13:11,732
Good morning!

144
00:13:17,421 --> 00:13:19,412
Listen, I have to ask you a favor.

145
00:13:19,461 --> 00:13:22,134
Please, call the largest
number of your friends possible!

146
00:13:25,621 --> 00:13:30,490
Go down, now! From today
on, you will work in this valley!

147
00:13:30,621 --> 00:13:33,374
How wicked he is!
You will pay for this!

148
00:13:34,581 --> 00:13:37,414
I wonder
what Sapphire is doing now!

149
00:13:51,581 --> 00:13:53,776
Princess Sapphire,
do your best!

150
00:13:54,101 --> 00:13:56,899
Damn Neelon, he thinks
I'm the fake Sapphire.

151
00:14:15,581 --> 00:14:18,015
Listen, now you can take off
your mask!

152
00:14:19,261 --> 00:14:21,650
Your performance
was admirable!

153
00:14:24,421 --> 00:14:28,209
Now you can speak freely
because it's just the two of us.

154
00:14:28,261 --> 00:14:31,617
I don't even know his
name How can I deceive him?

155
00:14:32,101 --> 00:14:34,092
Why aren't you speaking?

156
00:14:34,221 --> 00:14:36,974
- Please, shut up!
- What?!

157
00:14:37,461 --> 00:14:41,534
If I speak to you in a different
way than usual, Gelo will scold me!

158
00:14:41,581 --> 00:14:43,890
So it's better if I don't
speak to you at all!

159
00:14:46,021 --> 00:14:49,093
Yes, I know! Gelo is
very strict, you're right!

160
00:15:17,181 --> 00:15:19,251
She's back!

161
00:15:30,421 --> 00:15:32,889
Soon I will arrive
at Coolland Castle.

162
00:15:33,421 --> 00:15:36,015
I might die...
Oh, no...

163
00:15:36,141 --> 00:15:39,338
I won't be able to help my father and
my mother, if I let myself be overcome...

164
00:15:39,381 --> 00:15:41,975
...by weakness.
I must be stronger!

165
00:16:03,821 --> 00:16:07,018
What are you waiting for?
Soon we will reach the tunnel!

166
00:16:07,141 --> 00:16:09,701
In the tunnel there is no
snow all the way to the castle!

167
00:16:13,741 --> 00:16:15,811
Come on, damn it!

168
00:16:17,581 --> 00:16:20,653
Don't be lazy!
Hurry up! And work!

169
00:16:28,781 --> 00:16:30,817
Come on, charge!

170
00:16:32,541 --> 00:16:34,611
But those are mice!

171
00:16:34,661 --> 00:16:38,290
Thousands of mice!
Help!

172
00:16:55,421 --> 00:16:57,810
Mice! Come on, little mice, fight!

173
00:16:57,901 --> 00:17:00,256
Bite those arrogant soldiers!

174
00:17:09,781 --> 00:17:12,249
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

175
00:17:12,301 --> 00:17:14,895
We are free! We are free!

176
00:17:21,501 --> 00:17:23,856
Friends, please, help Sapphire!

177
00:17:23,901 --> 00:17:26,893
Let's defeat
Queen Icicle together!

178
00:17:47,461 --> 00:17:49,656
She thinks I am the fake Sapphire.

179
00:17:50,301 --> 00:17:52,610
Thank you for taking on
these troubles.

180
00:17:52,661 --> 00:17:54,697
It was a real pleasure, Queen.

181
00:17:54,741 --> 00:17:56,936
Now you can relax!
There is no one here,

182
00:17:56,981 --> 00:17:59,700
except those who know
that you are the fake Sapphire!

183
00:17:59,741 --> 00:18:02,380
- Yes...
- Now, if you affix the seal here

184
00:18:02,421 --> 00:18:05,731
- Silverland will become mine!
- But before that, Your Majesty.

185
00:18:06,941 --> 00:18:10,616
- What is it? - Have you really
captured the King and the Queen?

186
00:18:10,741 --> 00:18:13,574
Because Duke Geralamon
is truly worried...

187
00:18:13,621 --> 00:18:15,532
...and ordered me
to make sure of it.

188
00:18:15,701 --> 00:18:20,013
How cowardly!
All right, I'll show them to you! Let's go!

189
00:18:23,701 --> 00:18:25,498
Follow me.

190
00:18:46,741 --> 00:18:49,301
- Sapphire!
- You are Sapphire, aren't you?

191
00:18:50,021 --> 00:18:53,457
How stupid they are!
This is not your daughter!

192
00:18:53,541 --> 00:18:56,101
- No?!
- I'm sure it's Sapphire!

193
00:18:56,621 --> 00:18:59,089
Father! Mother!
Please, be quiet!

194
00:19:01,701 --> 00:19:05,216
- Take off your mask!
- Of course, I'll take it off right away!

195
00:19:13,581 --> 00:19:16,618
Open the cell if you don't
want me to kill the Queen!

196
00:19:17,621 --> 00:19:20,010
Just as I thought!
You are...

197
00:19:26,261 --> 00:19:30,140
- It's true, I am the real Sapphire!
- What are you saying?

198
00:19:30,661 --> 00:19:32,652
I'll show you my other face!

199
00:19:33,501 --> 00:19:35,890
You are the Phantom Knight!

200
00:19:35,981 --> 00:19:37,972
We will take Ghiacciolo
as a hostage...

201
00:19:38,021 --> 00:19:40,410
...and no one will hurt us!
- Thank you, Sapphire!

202
00:19:41,421 --> 00:19:43,412
Let us pass!

203
00:19:53,501 --> 00:19:55,412
Oh! Gelo!

204
00:19:56,501 --> 00:19:59,379
Kill the Phantom Knight!

205
00:20:02,341 --> 00:20:04,775
- Oh, mother..!
- Sapphire...

206
00:20:09,741 --> 00:20:11,174
No!

207
00:20:14,701 --> 00:20:17,613
It's an earthquake!
But it's lasting too long!

208
00:20:35,021 --> 00:20:37,012
The water in the moat!

209
00:20:40,021 --> 00:20:42,091
The water level is dropping!

210
00:20:47,501 --> 00:20:50,095
Cursed prisoners!
Fire! Fire!

211
00:20:57,901 --> 00:21:01,530
- It's time to defeat the
Queen - Come on, take up arms!

212
00:21:01,581 --> 00:21:06,211
- Let's help our comrades!
- Come on, here! Take them! Take them!

213
00:21:06,261 --> 00:21:08,729
Look,
the castle is burning!

214
00:21:14,301 --> 00:21:17,418
Good!
Kill Queen Icicle!

215
00:21:21,901 --> 00:21:23,937
The people managed to get inside!

216
00:21:24,221 --> 00:21:27,531
- Let's kill her!
- Let's catch her and kill her!

217
00:21:28,421 --> 00:21:31,219
What are
all my soldiers doing?

218
00:21:31,501 --> 00:21:33,571
My Queen,
the soldiers have betrayed you!

219
00:21:33,621 --> 00:21:35,816
They have joined the people
and are about to attack you!

220
00:21:35,861 --> 00:21:37,817
Run away or you will die like me!

221
00:21:40,621 --> 00:21:42,532
Quick, Gelo, let's escape!

222
00:21:55,821 --> 00:21:58,972
Sapphire!
The Queen has escaped!

223
00:21:59,021 --> 00:22:01,740
The fountain is a secret passage!

224
00:22:02,661 --> 00:22:04,572
Here, this must be it!

225
00:22:05,101 --> 00:22:07,296
Sapphire, please be careful!

226
00:22:15,781 --> 00:22:18,614
Gelo!
Queen Icicle!

227
00:22:32,101 --> 00:22:36,492
Oh, my God! Gelo!
Help! Help!

228
00:22:37,741 --> 00:22:39,732
Help!

229
00:22:49,101 --> 00:22:52,173
- The Queen has disappeared!
- Hooray!

230
00:23:01,821 --> 00:23:03,652
Hooray!

231
00:23:06,501 --> 00:23:10,016
No, people of Coolland!
It was you who helped me!

232
00:23:10,061 --> 00:23:12,416
And so: long live Coolland!

233
00:23:12,741 --> 00:23:15,255
- Long live!
- Hooray! Hooray!

234
00:23:27,941 --> 00:23:32,173
- What is she saying?
- Nothing. She's just spoiled!

235
00:23:45,181 --> 00:23:47,331
- Grand Duke, the King is coming!
- What?!

236
00:24:44,981 --> 00:24:48,601
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

237
00:24:48,602 --> 00:24:51,962
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

